# Zone 1, room 3 (grey box, Phase 1 task 7): tech 3, pogo chain.
# BUILD.md s5, tech 3: "Bounce off a line of enemies or hazards. Taught by a spike pit with Snuffed
# in it"; s15: "a 10-bounce chain across the zone 1 spike pit is possible at 4 bounces per second".
#
# Layout: a hall (18 tiles), a short patch of 3 spikes that a jump or one pogo clears (the safe
# first encounter: a hazard only sends Ash back to the hall's floor), then a tunnel 162 tiles
# (5184 u) long with spikes on its whole floor, then the east hall. The tunnel's ceiling is 64 u
# above the spikes: the player (44 u) can rise 20 u above them and no more, so a jump, a
# dash-jump or the air jump cannot arc over them, and a bounce (794 u/s) rises to the ceiling and
# falls back in 13 frames.
# Stand-ins: the spikes are the line of Snuffed (a hazard is pogo-able as an enemy is); no enemy
# stands in the pit yet.
#
# Why the pit needs pogo: the farthest non-pogo route found (a ground dash-jump, its air jump,
# the air dash and the Ember Toss, searched over every tick that matters) ends 672 u into the
# tunnel, 4512 u short of its far end (tests/replay/zone1/03_control_no_pogo.fixture).
# Why it needs at least 10 bounces, whatever is spent between them (review F2): the air dash and the
# air jump come back after every bounce, and the best chain found spends both on each (an air dash 9
# frames and an air jump 17 frames after the bounce, a down-strike 24 after it: a stride of 26 frames,
# 520 u, the dash-jump's 20 u/f kept). The first bounce lands at x 771 u. Nine bounces of that chain
# end in the spikes at x 5431 u, 329 u short of the tunnel's end (5760 u,
# zone1_03_control_nine_bounces); ten cross (zone1_03_route_fewest_bounces), at 2.3 bounces a
# second. A search over strides of 22 to 32 frames and a grid of dash and jump offsets found none
# did better. The plain chain (a down-strike on each fall, nothing between: the teaching route) takes
# 20 bounces, one every 13 frames (4.6 a second, over the 4 a second of s15), at the dash-jump's
# 20 u/f kept on every bounce (zone1_03_pogo_chain_route); at run speed (9 u/f) it would take 44.
room zone1/03_pogo_chain
size 196 34
spawn 96 608
tiles
